[{"title":"小园即事","author":"谢五娘","text":"翠竹苍梧手自栽，芙蓉未秀菊先开。\n小轩睡起日将午，黄叶满庭山雨来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43242,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜","author":"谢五娘","text":"银烛烧残夜漏声，画屏香案影孤清。\n一庭春色无人管，分付梨花伴月明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43243,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感怀","author":"谢五娘","text":"百岁因缘一旦休，三生石上事悠悠。\n无梁双陆难归马，恨点天牌不到头。\n千里月明千里恨，五更风雨五更愁。\n东风去后花无主，任尔随波逐水流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43244,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕遇雨","author":"谢五娘","text":"乞巧传杯不暂停，人间天上两关情。\n西风吹断牛郎泪，洒落帘前作雨声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43245,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳枝词","author":"谢五娘","text":"灞水桥头日正长，梳风沐雨是垂杨。\n可怜千缕黄金线，不与离人系断肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43246,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日得书","author":"谢五娘","text":"征夫天外怨离居，近接青江锦鲤书。\n明月似环人去后，碧天如水雁来初。\n梧桐叶落频惊梦，菱镜尘封久罢梳。\n愿作飞尘随远道，乘风犹得上君车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43247,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹夫人","author":"谢五娘","text":"青奴何事漫相轻，封号今同虢国荣。\n九夏专房非在貌，一身空洞若为情。\n君恩本自无心得，妇节从来彻骨清。\n叹惜班姬秋后扇，半生幽恨几时平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43248,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄怀","author":"谢五娘","text":"忆昔分携在柳阴，奇山上望桂山岑。\n手牵玉藕丝难断，口嚼青茶苦自禁。\n古镜不磨难对影，银釭未烬尚留心。\n一春孤馆同谁语，芭雨桐风夜夜深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43249,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武陵图","author":"谢五娘","text":"峰峦回合树青葱，茅屋参差一径通。\n匝地藤萝云护绿，满林桃杏雨含红。\n丝桐夜抚梅边月，石榻晴眠竹外风。\n避世已拚天下事，出山应笑紫芝翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43250,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花次于忠肃公原韵二首 其一","author":"谢五娘","text":"冰为骨格玉为神，姑射山前太逼真。\n岭外江山千万树，溪边林下两三人。\n脸无铅粉轻匀色，心有灵犀绝点尘。\n明月仙娥何处去，罗浮分得一枝春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43251,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花次于忠肃公原韵二首 其二","author":"谢五娘","text":"月明林下独凝神，疏影横斜为写真。\n净扫蛾眉妆镜女，轻移琼袖倚栏人。\n偏宜皓月偏宜雪，不受狂风不受尘。\n却怪南枝花满树，北枝犹自未经春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43252,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏牡丹用前韵","author":"谢五娘","text":"半似天仙半似神，半如崔氏镜中真。\n香迷五百烟花阵，色妒三千粉黛人。\n细雨微霏滋艳质，暖云重叠护芳尘。\n纷纷红紫争明媚，占尽风流富贵春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43253,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨花","author":"谢五娘","text":"江北江南路欲迷，回风轻态更依稀。\n雨晴炀帝宫前见，春晚陶潜门外飞。\n惜别有情还傍马，恼人无力故沾衣。\n飘零切莫随流水，化作浮萍何处归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43254,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"裁衣寄夫","author":"谢五娘","text":"灯下裁衣寄远人，漫拈针线倍伤神。\n愁多心绪牵成病，日久形容想未真。\n长短只依前日样，窄宽犹记旧时身。\n知君命走红尘外，劳碌于今瘦几分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43255,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨柳词","author":"谢五娘","text":"生长隋堤婀娜枝，玉骢曾系碧丝丝。\n可怜无力东风老，还向樽前绾别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43256,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦","author":"谢五娘","text":"春光曙色起新妆，鹦鹉杯传柏叶香。\n逐伴女儿相劝酒，殷勤先奉小姑尝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43257,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日思亲","author":"刘祖满","text":"懒剌鸳鸯出绣房，攒眉长日对横塘。\n梦回乡国云常白，心到东篱菊已黄。\n淩鹤自鸣阴上唳，陆怀多负洞庭霜。\n夜来何处寒砧急，又向西风下数行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43258,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春宵寄外","author":"刘祖满","text":"萝月娟娟净，三星耿耿明。\n曲栏深睡犬，脩竹暗巢莺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43259,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫人拈笔图","author":"刘祖满","text":"倦倚西风十二楼，苦吟彊半为悲秋。\n几回搦管题红叶，怕逐春泉出御沟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43260,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫人春睡图","author":"刘祖满","text":"几度逢春几度愁，和衣閒卧晚妆楼。\n彊寻一枕承恩梦，为语鸡人莫报筹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43261,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"靖节堂竹陈太夫人限韵命赋","author":"刘祖满","text":"为爱庭前竹，猗猗曲槛中。\n孤高撑落日，劲直扫秋风。\n龙去投筇巧，鸾归制笛工。\n平生好修节，赖有此君同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43262,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜寄外","author":"刘祖满","text":"绣户三星动，虚庭一叶飞。\n萤流残暑退，雁带早凉归。\n班女悲藏扇，征人未授衣。\n病同黄菊瘦，谁复念鲈肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43263,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"待旦","author":"刘祖满","text":"不寐当明发，沿阶扫落红。\n晓风斜燕子，残月语鸡翁。\n炉冷衔金兽，灯寒缀玉虫。\n捲帘来曙色，抬镜若为容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43264,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听文三娘鼓琴","author":"刘祖满","text":"一叶向秋飞，文姬塞外归。\n冰弦调玉指，银烛蔼金徽。\n离燕随声度，吟龙叶韵微。\n未央今夜月，徒捣受降衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43265,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与表妹蕙若舍奕话旧","author":"刘祖满","text":"手谈心力拙，耳语口脂香。\n以旧相思告，将新嘉会忘。\n乡音方半改，卷发尚前妆。\n既见终疑梦，悬心犹未降。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43266,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张夫人还楚","author":"刘祖满","text":"满船箫鼓夕阳中，顷刻云山即万重。\n清泪下同三峡水，绪怀叠作九疑峰。\n今从跃鲤桥边别，后向华胥国里逢。\n挥手挂帆天际外，深闺何处问行踪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43267,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小筑落成喜外杜门次韵","author":"刘祖满","text":"混迹何妨木石居，幽栖时亦爱吾庐。\n客从蓬户题凡鸟，人在松窗辨鲁鱼。\n杞菊径荒成独往，草茅路长莫教锄。\n春深雨过苔痕滑，免顾梁王雪后车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43268,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朱叔母招同李郁李诸姊妹游北园","author":"刘祖满","text":"北园之乐乐如何，花底藏阄石上歌。\n云破数峰浓似墨，风摇一水绿于罗。\n地烹甫里能言鸭，草乳羲之换帖鹅。\n醉插山花君莫笑，人生会少别离多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43269,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄外","author":"刘祖满","text":"椎秦博浪谓当车，消息传来事又虚。\n肯把壮心酬一切，莫将词赋吊三闾。\n怀中字减祢衡刺，袖里红啼贾谊书。\n海上钓鳌应有饵，可愁为客食无鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43270,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢李郁李古砚","author":"刘祖满","text":"铜雀云封泽未乾，摛文墨海起汪澜。\n蟾蜍滴带阴山润，鸲鹆星分璧水寒。\n晋帝赐司麟笔重，王慈取并素琴端。\n不磷磨尽坚如许，敢作他山一石看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43271,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雁","author":"刘祖满","text":"一声嘹呖动闺愁，顾影连翩直过楼。\n不分世途争冷暖，却从天外避春秋。\n书空漫借云为纸，草圣何怜月作钩。\n关塞久无持节使，上林休作致书邮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43272,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斥野燐","author":"刘祖满","text":"临池耽访卫夫人，衙鼓铜龙已报寅。\n曲槛骋光金马影，画屏曦耀碧鸡燐。\n久将正气留天地，岂有文章泣鬼神。\n花际漫劳誇伎俩，燃犀曾照本来身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43273,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诀外与鸾儿","author":"刘祖满","text":"飞琼曾报玉楼成，将驾青虬上玉京。\n三载未偿夫妇债，一年难尽母儿情。\n鹃辞蜀国仍称帝，鹤到辽城亦姓丁。\n去去不须伤往事，等闲捡点白云程。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43274,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明","author":"刘祖满","text":"万户千门柳色新，北邙荒草没麒麟。\n闺中未识先贤冢，惟向书堆拜古人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43275,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绣观音","author":"刘祖满","text":"缨络幢幡斗巧工，绣成非色亦非空。\n慈容普向金针现，不尽婆心万缕中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43276,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫人拈笔图","author":"刘祖满","text":"倦倚西风十二楼，苦吟强半为悲秋。\n几回搦管题红叶，怕作良媒出御沟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43277,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏月寄外","author":"刘祖满","text":"无端挂镜复张弦，遇缺缺兮圆自圆。\n赢得一身浑似我，当圆当缺在于天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43278,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄外","author":"刘祖满","text":"桃花灼灼柳依依，书寄王孙归未归。\n亭院莺啼春又晚，援琴时奏雉南飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43279,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"馈周小姐莲蓬却寄","author":"刘祖满","text":"粉坠红销水殿香，西风摇动绿蜂房。\n也知心苦难成蜜，寄与云英捣玉霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43280,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅","author":"刘祖满","text":"雪压疏林香满枝，夜深微露濯冰肌。\n巡檐未许尘心赏，惟有孤山处士知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43281,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟闺词 其一","author":"刘祖满","text":"棠梨谁道可忘忧，百结原因鼓子愁。\n含笑邻家七姊妹，兰房夜夜合凉州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43282,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟闺词 其二","author":"刘祖满","text":"日午时阳露未乾，抚桐指甲怯春寒。\n葵心解语浑含笑，蝴蝶频飞觅合欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43283,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟闺词 其三","author":"刘祖满","text":"灯盏擎花玉蕊寒，满天星斗瑞香残。\n粉团小玉无颜色，何必胭脂写牡丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43284,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟闺词 其一","author":"刘祖满","text":"杜鹃啼血闹阳回，百日红侵石上苔。\n愁听孩儿歌白苧，日长春尽碧桃开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43285,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟闺词 其二","author":"刘祖满","text":"雀舌无停嗓杏林，柳腰宽褪石榴裙。\n橙黄橘绿无消息，卜尽金钱为此君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43286,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日翠坳漫成","author":"刘祖满","text":"不及窥园两月馀，石顽当户未经锄。\n风摇竹粉拖人面，昼永花泥落燕庐。\n渚芷乘春随意绿，鹤翎因两任情梳。\n虚堂寂历心逾静，坐听寒岩溜决渠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43287,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花朝戏以花名成诗","author":"刘祖满","text":"春半枝头花尽开，会喧人扑蝶飞来。\n三眠杨柳风惊起，一睡梨花梦未回。\n脸上薄沽红杏雨，掌中尽覆绿荷杯。\n湘裙欲绣虞姬草，自剪梅罗带月裁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43288,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五月端午偕女伴游海印","author":"刘祖满","text":"雀航乘潮似渡泸，钗头轻挂辟兵符。\n珠遗汉浦谁家女，印解湘潭楚大夫。\n城撼怒涛摇粉堞，江吞斜日浸浮图。\n归来聊把诸姬问，适听莲歌记得无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43289,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荔枝","author":"刘祖满","text":"岭南五月荔如丹，望若虬珠颗颗圆。\n叶带密云笼鹤顶，枝迎疏雨湿鸡冠。\n擘来崖蜜侵衣腻，嚼去琼浆溅齿寒。\n莫厌食多愁内热，红尘无复到长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43290,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏望夫石","author":"刘祖满","text":"陟彼崔嵬望稿砧，愁容无古复无今。\n一峰屹立如人影，万劫难移匪石心。\n螺髻蓬飞青草乱，蛾眉煤画绿苔侵。\n归帆数遍穷消息，时听清猿两岸吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43291,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登白云山","author":"刘祖满","text":"乐事原因病得闲，烧香约伴共登山。\n蛟潜阴壑愁金锁，猿啸晴溪怨玉环。\n香积半藏青嶂里，梵声远出白云间。\n重来此地知何会，须记沿崖细菊斑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43292,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋信","author":"刘祖满","text":"金风摇绣阁，玉露冷妆台。\n暑气萤流去，秋声雁带来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43293,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送黄嫂从宦中州","author":"刘祖满","text":"杨柳千条复万条，断肠攀折在今朝。\n剩枝不许黄莺坐，留结同心寄洛桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43294,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕","author":"刘祖满","text":"堪笑东邻各女儿，声喧檐外斗蛛丝。\n经年莫织回文锦，试问天孙巧与谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43295,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"集李年姒西园采菱","author":"刘祖满","text":"蕴怀珠玉泛清波，采采旁人劝渡河。\n拉伴却回烟棹去，白蘋风急晓霜多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43296,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五月初五家宴无荔嘲夫","author":"刘祖满","text":"悔将来作岭南人，三百虬珠解误身。\n岂为楚臣沉绿水，不教妃子笑红尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43297,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"虞美人花","author":"刘祖满","text":"楚歌声唱霸图空，生许相从死亦从。\n血溅鸟江原上草，花开犹带泪痕重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43298,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"千叶桃花","author":"刘祖满","text":"重台灼灼醉酴酥，叠锦堆霞胜画图。\n面忆马嵬妆堕后，此花还亦助娇无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43299,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"素馨花","author":"刘祖满","text":"翠积花田玉露繁，幽香微度近黄昏。\n浪传点额宫人魄，那解侬家侍女魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43300,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兰花","author":"刘祖满","text":"九畹滋兮事亦奇，鼓琴谁解曲中词。\n林深日午春风起，空谷无人独秀时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43301,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杜鹃花","author":"刘祖满","text":"醉态轻盈浥露斜，映山红火幕难遮。\n最怜阆苑春归后，九月重开二月花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43302,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花","author":"刘祖满","text":"寒梅昨夜花更发，今日因风落二三。\n莫教倚楼人弄笛，暂留春色驻江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43303,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丁香花","author":"刘祖满","text":"百结愁肠不可排，花开微两滴空阶。\n更闻帘外虫声唧，恼乱妆楼十二钗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43304,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"刘祖满","text":"杨柳青青夹岸斜，绿蘋深处隐渔家。\n分明一幅桃源景，独少沿流几树花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43305,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼鹤","author":"刘祖满","text":"珠树三花落更开，乘轩无复登此台。\n学成华表仙人去，莫作横江道士来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43306,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢黄嫂惠茶","author":"刘祖满","text":"斜印遥封寄远情，品泉敲臼按经烹。\n卢仝未必相如渴，只爱清风两腋生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43307,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"妆楼晓望","author":"刘祖满","text":"绣阁花深日透迟，小桃才放两三枝。\n晓来谁泼遥岭翠，折柳燃煤学画眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43308,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看美人舞剑","author":"何瑶英","text":"出匣电飞掣，纤腰气激昂。\n龙泉腾月白，秋水耀星光。\n娇艳英雄托，恩仇生死忘。\n深闺修剑术，珍重在行藏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43309,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日登楼漫兴","author":"何瑶英","text":"节逢九日一登楼，黄菊茱萸插满头。\n沙渚已过千里雁，蓬莱曾梦七花虬。\n江门近泛溁光浅，桂岭遥连积翠浮。\n结伴但从高处立，深闺何用买山游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43310,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园梅未放速之以诗","author":"何瑶英","text":"小阳暖透越人家，尚拥寒根懒着花。\n滴滴蕊珠含晓梦，迟迟春信绕天涯。\n一年雪后香魂暗，几日闺中酒兴赊。\n如此月明还冉冉，恐教群卉候繁华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43311,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"官梅阁题壁","author":"邱恭娘","text":"十日离家心已稀，愁眉生怕送残晖。\n天涯破镜知谁在，塞外悲鸿去不归。\n望到故山心化石，听来杜宇泪沾衣。\n五更画角城头月，吹落旗亭促马飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43312,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和题壁元韵","author":"赵玑姊","text":"分明笔仗影依稀，惊阵啼鸦散夕晖。\n去国元同千古恨，抱琴应共九泉归。\n才高柳絮馀香沈，命薄桃花卸舞衣。\n泪眼相逢何日事，一声鼙鼓各魂飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":43313,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]